Accessibility, on purpose (a11y-oop)

RHDS accessibility guidance and associated example assets are adapted from
Red Hat Design System, RedHat-UX/red-hat-design-system, source revision
7b65f1378496ac57cc207be8f84822afc8180345. Original source Markdown and hashes
are retained in vendor/rhds/accessibility and data/rhds-sources.json.

Checklist synthesis incorporates contributor-supplied Greg Gibson Web QA
exports, UX Dot accessibility planning material, a DX checklist cheat sheet,
and a JSON checklist attributed by the contributor to Heydon Pickering.
Original wording, sources and mappings are retained in data/checklist.json.
The supplied source PDFs are not distributed.

RHDS/W3C quotations, linked materials and third-party assets retain their
original attribution. The project LICENSE does not replace applicable
third-party terms or grant rights in third-party trademarks.

